    <string name="glutton_help">How to play</string>
    <string name="glutton_rules">Drag anywhere to move, release to brake.\n\nAnything smaller than you gets swallowed and sticks to your body. Bites close to your own size (green halo) grow you fastest and show their name. Swallow the golden landmark to move on: the fridge, the greenhouse, then the town hall.\n\nCats, robot vacuums, dogs and cars bump you while you are small and knock a few things loose: just eat them back. Once you outgrow them they run away, and catching one earns 2 seconds.\n\nVacuum pulls everything in reach and stuns chasers. Chain bites for combos; five of the same family in a row is a bonus streak.\n\nThree stars per area: swallow the landmark, find the three golden treasures, beat the par time.</string>
    <string name="glutton_drag">Drag to munch</string>
    <string name="glutton_touch">Drag to move your gobbler. The map shows the landmark and the creatures.</string>
